
  Field Notes is live at https://fieldnotes.example.com

  You're signed in to the admin in your browser.
  Setup also emailed a sign-in link to sam@example.com.

  To protect your computer, setup didn't run dependency
  install scripts. If a dependency needs its script, go
  to /home/sam/sites/field-notes and run npm rebuild.

  Setup couldn't remove its access to your Cloudflare account.
  In your Cloudflare profile, select Access Management, and then
  Connected Applications. Find cairn and revoke its access.

  Edit your site    fieldnotes.example.com/admin
  Invite an editor  Admin > Editors
  Read the docs     cairn.pub/docs

  Setup took 8:12.
